# Self-hosted on-device model assets — provisioned at build/deploy by
# `npm run provision:stt` (STT: transformers.js engine + ONNX Runtime wasm +
# Moonshine/Whisper weights), `npm run provision:llm` (U5 listener: engine +
# the small instruct-model weights), and `npm run provision:tts` (U6 voice:
# engine + the small TTS-model weights). Never committed: large binaries, and the
# no-egress design serves them same-origin from public/ → dist/. Absent → the
# adapters use their labelled stubs (the TTS adapter a placeholder tone). The
# committed public/stt-engine.js, public/llm-engine.js and public/tts-engine.js
# wrappers are NOT under these paths. public/models/ is the shared weight tree.
public/stt/
public/llm/
public/tts/
public/models/
